            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KO"} KO
            = succeed ")." do
              %a{:href => "#Wilson16"} Wilson 16, remark 3.34
          %p#EquivariantKOOfThePoint
            In fact,
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+KO-theory"} equivariant KO-theory
            of the point subsumes the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/representation+rings"} representation rings
            over the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/real+numbers"} real numbers
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+numbers"} complex numbers
            and the
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quaternions"} quaternions
          .maruku-equation
