              = succeed "," do
                %em D-Branes And K-Theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9810188"} arXiv:hep-th/9810188
          %p but it was pointed out that only a subgroup or quotient group of equivariant K-theory can be physically relevant, in
          %ul
